Package: lomad
Title: Local Moving Average Decoupling
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Trevor", "Ruiz", email = "truiz01@calpoly.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Alea", "Seifert", role = c("aut")),
    person("Catherine", "Mispagel", role = c("aut")),
    person("Emma", "Hamilton", role = c("aut")))
Description: Detects and characterizes periods of decoupling between two
    time series using correlations between local moving averages. Provides 
    parametric bootstrap inference for decoupling rate, mean run length, and 
    fraction of time in the low-correlation state.
